dialogue prologue_glint
title: The Glint
trigger: Prologue Glint
backdrop: greenvalley
speaker commander $commander
speaker redmage redmage
speaker knight knight

node tome redmage
  Bolt. A lightning spell, and an old one. The Collector had no idea what he was sitting on.
  -> glint

node glint commander
  On a bare hilltop by the road, something catches the light. It glints at you, and only at you.
  -> nothing

node nothing knight
  There's nothing there. Grass and a rock.
  -> them

node them redmage
  There is for them. Look at the orbs. Take us up there.
